*.ISO
*.XEX
*.zip
*.ZIP
*.rar
*.7Z
*.xiso
*.sfd
*.SFD
*.adx
*.ADX
*.cab
*.stfs
**/game_data_root*/
**/user_data/
*.apk
*.aab
*.dmg
